### 1. Deal & Portfolio Management Platform (Private Debt / Real Estate Lending)

*Senior Full Stack Developer · .NET 8, EF Core, React 19, TypeScript, ag-Grid Enterprise, Azure Service Bus, SendGrid*

Built the deal lifecycle management system for a multi-tenant fund administration platform, covering investment/lending transactions from origination through NAV reporting.

- Designed the core deal domain model capturing lending terms (multi-bucket commitment amounts, LTV/LTC, fixed/variable interest structures), dual-currency pricing (local + EUR), operational role assignments, and ESG scoring.
- Built a quarterly NAV (Net Asset Value) import and approval workflow with role-gated authorization across a five-role hierarchy (Fund Lead, NAV Admin, PM Lead/Analyst/Support), batch import statuses, adjustments, and overrides used to calculate Limited Partner returns.
- Implemented a schema-less "data register" feature letting fund managers define custom deal-tracking columns at runtime without database migrations, using a metadata-driven column/data-point design.
- Developed investor ownership composition tracking maintained by durable background tasks, with investor anonymization for LP-facing reporting.
- Delivered hierarchical portfolio grouping with SFDR (EU sustainability regulation) compliance tracking, plus automated deal notifications via SendGrid and cross-module currency conversion and cashflow generation.

