### 3. Real Estate Asset & Collateral Management System

*Senior Full Stack Developer · .NET 8, React 19, TypeScript, Azure Cognitive Search, Azure Blob Storage, Google Maps APIs*

Built the collateral management system representing the real estate assets backing lending deals, with rich search, valuation, and media capabilities.

- Designed a hierarchical asset domain model with a two-level property taxonomy (residential, hotel, office, industrial, retail, land, mixed-use), parent/child composite properties, and physical, financial, and geographic attributes (valuations, rent/occupancy/yield, lat/lon, energy rating).
- Implemented full-text asset search and faceted filtering with Azure Cognitive Search, including the cross-module indexing contract and indexer pipeline.
- Built an asset photo management pipeline on Azure Blob Storage supporting primary/secondary/floor-plan/360° image types with display ordering, blob-to-metadata reconciliation, and validation rules (single primary photo, duplicate path rejection).
- Enforced domain integrity rules such as requiring every asset to be either deal-linked collateral or a designated "comparable" benchmark property used for valuation comparisons.
- Integrated Google Street View for embedded location previews, and delivered type-specific REST APIs and React views per property class, plus valuation and operating-performance tracking endpoints.

